    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/e3ff8396b2cebbc76dd421875794bce2.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/e3ff8396b2cebbc76dd421875794bce2.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/e3ff8396b2cebbc76dd421875794bce2.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls to get them to reach the top of each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/db8c93a9ad0359fffa715c23f4df925b.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/db8c93a9ad0359fffa715c23f4df925b.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/db8c93a9ad0359fffa715c23f4df925b.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get money for each ball that hits the goal. Buy upgrades and complete the level objectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/06276ca8ea17ca9c91c3d72c6af61bc3.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/06276ca8ea17ca9c91c3d72c6af61bc3.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/06276ca8ea17ca9c91c3d72c6af61bc3.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final objective to gain progression points you can use to buy permanent stat increases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d3245427acf1afb59cdfcf375fbe484b.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d3245427acf1afb59cdfcf375fbe484b.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d3245427acf1afb59cdfcf375fbe484b.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the final objective before the timer runs out to prestige: reset your progress to multiply how much you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't break your mouse: clicking without missing increases your split multiplier, so don't spam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle playstyle: make a lot of balls and chill if you want passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active playstyle: click the balls while they're on the top floor to score goals faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategy: upgrades cost more each time you make a purchase, so you need to optimize your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value: level objectives and rewards are randomized each time you play.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/e3ff8396b2cebbc76dd421875794bce2.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/e3ff8396b2cebbc76dd421875794bce2.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/e3ff8396b2cebbc76dd421875794bce2.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls to get them to reach the top of each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/db8c93a9ad0359fffa715c23f4df925b.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/db8c93a9ad0359fffa715c23f4df925b.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/db8c93a9ad0359fffa715c23f4df925b.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get money for each ball that hits the goal. Buy upgrades and complete the level objectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/06276ca8ea17ca9c91c3d72c6af61bc3.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/06276ca8ea17ca9c91c3d72c6af61bc3.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/06276ca8ea17ca9c91c3d72c6af61bc3.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final objective to gain progression points you can use to buy permanent stat increases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d3245427acf1afb59cdfcf375fbe484b.poster.avif?t=1753467122\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d3245427acf1afb59cdfcf375fbe484b.webm?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d3245427acf1afb59cdfcf375fbe484b.mp4?t=1753467122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the final objective before the timer runs out to prestige: reset your progress to multiply how much you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't break your mouse: clicking without missing increases your split multiplier, so don't spam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle playstyle: make a lot of balls and chill if you want passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active playstyle: click the balls while they're on the top floor to score goals faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategy: upgrades cost more each time you make a purchase, so you need to optimize your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value: level objectives and rewards are randomized each time you play.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An incremental game where you get money when you hit the goal at the top of each level. Click the balls to make them split until you fill the entire level with them. Optimize your build and buy meta upgrades to increase how much you\u2019ll make. Watch the balls bounce around and make money.",
